<title>JAPAN: Kirin in talks to buy units of US seed firm Yoder.</title>
<headline>Kirin in talks to buy units of US seed firm Yoder.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kirin Beverage Corp said on Wednesday it was negotiating with Yoder Brothers of the United States to buy three of the flower and seed firm's units.</p>
<p>The two are discussing details of Kirin's possible purchase of Yoder's units in Germany, Britain and Kenya, Kirin said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;We have already signed a letter of intent and we will negotiate further with Yoder,&quot; Kirin said.</p>
<p>It did not elaborate.</p>
</text>
